an MMRM. The difference between pegcetacoplan and eculizumab LS mean changes from Baseline at Week 16 was calculated along with its 2-sided 95% CI and associated P-value from the MMRM model for the ITT set, censored for transfusions.\",\"pValue\":\"0.3002\",\"pValueComment\":\"MMRM includes treatment + baseline value + analysis visit + strata + analysis visit × treatment, where strata is the combination of randomization stratification factors.\",\"statisticalMethod\":\"MMRM\",\"paramType\":\"LS mean difference\",\"paramValue\":\"-7.95\",\"ciPctValue\":\"95\",\"ciNumSides\":\"TWO_SIDED\",\"ciLowerLimit\":\"-23.23\",\"ciUpperLimit\":\"7.33\"},{\"groupIds\":[\"OG000\",\"OG001\"],\"groupDescription\":\"Symptom Scales - Constipation: Difference in LS mean\",\"nonInferiorityType\":\"OTHER\",\"nonInferiorityComment\":\"Analysis was a between-treatment-group comparison using an MMRM. The difference between pegcetacoplan and eculizumab LS mean changes from Baseline at Week 16 was calculated along with its 2-sided 95% CI and associated P-value from the MMRM model for the ITT set, censored for transfusions.\",\"pValue\":\"0.8374\",\"pValueComment\":\"MMRM includes treatment + baseline value + analysis visit + strata + analysis visit × treatment, where strata is the combination of randomization stratification factors.\",\"statisticalMethod\":\"MMRM\",\"paramType\":\"LS mean difference\",\"paramValue\":\"1.79\",\"ciPctValue\":\"95\",\"ciNumSides\":\"TWO_SIDED\",\"ciLowerLimit\":\"-15.70\",\"ciUpperLimit\":\"19.29\"},{\"groupIds\":[\"OG000\",\"OG001\"],\"groupDescription\":\"Symptom Scales - Diarrhoea: Difference in LS mean\",\"nonInferiorityType\":\"OTHER\",\"nonInferiorityComment\":\"Analysis was a between-treatment-group comparison using an MMRM. The difference between pegcetacoplan and eculizumab LS mean changes from Baseline at Week 16 was calculated along with its 2-sided 95% CI and associated P-value from the MMRM model for the ITT set, censored for transfusions.\",\"pValu